{"id":"vod_bf_14239","vodId":"14239","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"花牌情缘第一季","name_cn":"花牌情缘第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/3d81397c647828bfddd7e3066502d183.jpg"},"summary":"从小时候起，绫濑千早（濑户麻沙美 配音）的理想就只有一个——辅佐姐姐绫濑千岁（远藤绫 配音）成为日本第一的模特，为了实现这个理想，千早可谓是不择手段。但是，一个名为绵谷新（细谷佳正 配音）的转学生彻底打碎了她的幻觉。“不是自己的事就不算梦想！”被绵谷一语点醒的千早决定将 理想转移到绵谷教会她的“小仓百人一首竞技花牌”上，一个全新的，为了自己的理想而不断奋斗的千早新鲜出炉了！　　作为青梅竹马，完美少年真岛太一（宫野真守 配音）一直暗恋着千早，可不知如何表达感情的他却总是忍不住的要欺负心爱着的千早。眼看着千早和绵谷因为花牌越走越近，太一决定加入他们的“花牌社”，同时也开始了千早的争夺战。时光飞逝，三人早已因为花牌而结下了深厚的友谊，毕业在即，三人约定，只要花牌存在一天，他们就终会再见面。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 21:36:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huapaiqingyuandiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url